        "original_id": "f55b734d-5810-5410-bbae-091143cbaa32",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: C.J. Segerstrom & Sons, Irvine Company\n- Families: O'Neill family, Segerstrom family\n- Places: Orange County, Costa Mesa, California\n- Projects: South Coast Plaza\n- Topics: real estate, shopping malls, luxury retail\n\nFacts:\n- C.J. Segerstrom & Sons is a family business that became a major real estate company in Orange County, alongside the Irvine Company and the O'Neill family, especially in Costa Mesa.\n- In 1967, C.J. Segerstrom & Sons began construction of South Coast Plaza.\n- South Coast Plaza is an upscale luxury-goods shopping mall in Costa Mesa, California.\n- South Coast Plaza is anchored by three Macy's stores, Sears, Nordstrom, Bloomingdale's, and Saks Fifth Avenue.",
